  https://github.com/libyal/libevtx/archive/refs/tags/20260705.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libevtx-20260705-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libevtx-20260705-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libevtx-20260705-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevtx-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevtx1-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevtx-devel-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libevtx-20260705-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libevtx)
  /usr/bin/evtxexport.exe
  /usr/bin/evtxinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libevtx.README
  /usr/share/doc/libevtx/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libevtx/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libevtx/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libevtx/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libevtx/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/evtxexport.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/evtxinfo.1.gz

(libevtx1)
  /usr/bin/cygevtx-1.dll

(libevtx-devel)
  /usr/include/libevtx.h
  /usr/include/libevtx/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libevtx/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libevtx/error.h
  /usr/include/libevtx/extern.h
  /usr/include/libevtx/features.h
  /usr/include/libevtx/types.h
  /usr/lib/libevtx.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libevtx.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libevtx.3.gz

(python312-libevtx)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyevtx.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

